          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባሕርይ ፡ እንስሳዊ ፡ ባሕርይ፡ መልአካዊ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ ባሕርይ፡ እንስሳዊ ፡ ምግብ፡ ሲያጣ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሞታል ፡ ባሕርይ ፡ መልአካዊ ፡ ትምህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርት ፡ ሲያጣ ፡ ይጎዳል ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ አእምር፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ ቃለ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ሲሳይ ፡ ዘበአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማን ፡ ሲሲተ ፡ ልብ ፡ ቃላቲሁ ፡ ለእግዚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አብሔር ፡ አመጽእ ፡ ረኀበ ፡ እክል ፡ ወፅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምዐ ፡ ማይ ፡ አኮ ፡ ረኀበ ፡ እክል ፡ ወፅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምዐ ፡ ማይ ፡ ረኀብሰ ፡ ወፅምዕ ፡ ኢሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሚዐ ፡ ቃለ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ እንዲል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢረከብኩ ፡ ግብረከ ፡ ፍጹመ ፡ በቅድመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አምላኪየ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በፈጣሪዬ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ሥራህን ፡ ፍጹም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆኖ ፡ አላገኘሁትምና ፡ ቍ ፡ ፲፱ ። ሕዝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፬ ፡ ፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወተዘከር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አስተውል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እፎ ፡ ነሣእከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መክሊቱን ፡ ለምን ፡ ተቀበልህ ፡ ሹመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱን ፡ ለምን ፡ ተሾምህ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰማዕከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምን ፡ ሲልስ ፡ ሰምተኸው ፡ ነበረ ፡ ገብር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሀካይ ፡ ለምንት ፡ ኢያግባእከ ፡ ወርቅየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውስተ ፡ ማዕድየ ፡ ሲል ፡ ሰምተኸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አልነበረምን ። አንድም ፡ ትምህርቱን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለምን ፡ ነሣሃቸው ፡ ምን ፡ ሲልስ ፡ ሰም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተኸው ፡ ነበረ ፡ በከንቱ ፡ ዘነሣእክሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በከንቱ ፡ ሀቡ ፡ በጸጋ ፡ ዘነሣእክሙ ፡ በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸጋ ፡ ሀቡ ፡ ሲል ፡ ሰምተኸው ፡ አልነበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረምን ። አንድም ፡ እፎ ፡ ሰማዕከ ፡ ወነሣ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እከ ፡ ነገረ ፡ ሠሪ፡ ሰምተህ ፡ ትምህርቱን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለምን ፡ ነሣሃቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ነስሕ ፡ እንከ ፡ ወእመሰ ፡ ኢተጋህከ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተው ፡ ተመለስ ፡ ተግተህ ፡ አስተምር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተግተህ ፡ ባታስተምር ፡ ግን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እበጽሐከ ፡ ግብተ ፡ ከመ ፡ ሠራቂ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ሌባ ፡ አመጣጥ ፡ ድንገት ፡ እመጣ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሃለሁ፡ ሐተታ ፡ሌባ ፡ ባላሰቡት ፡ ዕለት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባልጠረጠሩት ፡ ሰዓት ፡ እንዲመጣ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢተአምር ፡ በአይ ፡ ሰዓት ፡ እመጽእ ፡ ላዕሌከ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በማናቸውም ፡ ሰዓት ፡ እንድመጣ ፡ አታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውቅምና ፡ ፩ ፡ ተሰ ፡ ፭ ፡ ፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፬ ፤ ⟪ወባሕቱ ፡ ብከ ፡ ኅዳጣን ፡ ሰብእ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ሰር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዴስ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገር ፡ ግን ፡ በሰርዴስ ፡ ጥቂቶች ፡ ሰዎች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሉህ ፡ በዚህ ፡ አልነቅፍህም ፡ ማለቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እለ ፡ ኢገመኑ ፡ አልባሲሆሙ ፡ ምስለ ፡ አንስት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰውነታቸውን ፡ ከሴቶች ፡ ጋራ ፡ ያላሳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደፉ ። አንድም ፡ ሰውነታቸውን ፡ በኃጢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አት ፡ ያላሳደፉ ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ ወትነብር ፡ ብእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲት ፡ ማእከለ ፡ መስፈርት ፡ እንዲል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወየሐውሩ ፡ ምስሌከ ፡ በንጹሕ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ካንተ ፡ ጋራ ፡ እንዳንተ ፡ በንጹሕ ፡ ነገር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸንተው፡ የሚኖሩ ። አንድም ፡ በንጽሕና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸንተው ፡ የሚኖሩ ፡ ይሁዳ ፡ ቍ ፡ ፳፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": "፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፭ ፤ ⟪ወለዘሞዐሰ ፡ ከመዝ ፡ ልብሰ ፡ ንጹሐ ፡ ይደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልዎ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐኬትን ፡ በትጋት ፡ ኃጢአትን ፡ በንጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕና ፡ ድል ፡ ለነሣ ፡ እንዲህ ፡ ያለ ፡ ንጹሕ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልብስ ፡ ይገባዋል ፡ አለ ፡ ክብር ፡ ይገባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢይደመሰስ ፡ ስሙ ፡ እምነ ፡ መጽሐፈ ፡ ሕይወት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስሙ ፡ ከሕይወት ፡ መጽሐፍ ፡ አይፋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅም ፡ አለ ፡ በልበ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
